## 2. after
$ swift test --filter TraceSwitchTests   # after
  ✔ Test run with 4 tests in 1 suite passed after 0.016 seconds.
  and SECURITY.md now says what the switch does:
    `CHATBOTS_TRACE_API=1` makes the client print each request to the endpoint on standard error, so
    that a protocol problem can be seen. It prints the first 2 000 characters of the body and replaces

## 3. the style the fix had to keep
  The first extraction left the helper's body under-indented and checked the switch twice;
  rewriting it cleanly took authored swift-format from 747 to 743 for this file, and the gate
  reads 740 against its 744 waiver. swiftlint stayed 255.
